---
// src/components/AboutSection.astro — Pure HTML statis, Googlebot bisa baca
---

<section
  id="about"
  class="min-h-screen flex items-center px-6 md:px-12 py-24"
  style="background: linear-gradient(160deg,#f0fdf4 0%,#dcfce7 20%,#f8fafc 50%,#fef9c3 80%,#fff7ed 100%);"
  aria-labelledby="about-heading"
>
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto w-full flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-12 md:gap-16">

    <!-- Image + Stats -->
    <div class="flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col items-center gap-6">
      <div class="relative">
        <div class="absolute -inset-2 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-100 to-violet-100 opacity-60"></div>
        <img
          src="/about.png"
          alt="Maulana Nur Anfajm sedang bekerja — fullstack developer Universitas Gunadarma"
          class="relative w-64 md:w-72 rounded-2xl shadow-xl object-cover ring-4 ring-white"
          width="288"
          height="360"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>

      <!-- Stats -->
      <div class="flex gap-4 w-full justify-center">
        {[
          { value: "6th", label: "Semester" },
          { value: "4",   label: "Proyek"   },
          { value: "3",   label: "Bidang"   },
        ].map(s => (
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center bg-white rounded-2xl px-4 py-3 shadow-sm border border-slate-100 flex-1 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform">
            <span class="text-xl font-extrabold text-slate-900">{s.value}</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-medium mt-0.5">{s.label}</span>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Text -->
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-5 text-center md:text-left">
      <div>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-slate-400 uppercase mb-2">Siapa saya</p>
        <h2 id="about-heading" class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 leading-tight">
          Tentang Saya
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="h-0.5 w-10 bg-slate-200 rounded-full self-center md:self-start"></div>

      <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed text-base">
        Halo! Saya <strong class="text-slate-800">Maulana Nur Anfajm</strong>, dikenal online sebagai
        <strong class="text-slate-800">Lananuranf</strong> — mahasiswa
        <strong class="text-slate-800">Sistem Informasi semester 6</strong> di
        <strong class="text-slate-800">Universitas Gunadarma</strong>, Jakarta.
        Saya senang membangun aplikasi web dari frontend sampai deploy, dan mengolah data
        untuk menjawab pertanyaan nyata.
      </p>

      <p class="text-slate-500 leading-relaxed text-sm">
        Saya belajar paling banyak lewat praktik: membuat proyek, men-deploy-nya ke server,
        lalu memperbaiki yang masih kurang. Saat ini saya fokus di tiga bidang:
        pengembangan web fullstack, data science, dan dasar-dasar DevOps &amp; keamanan aplikasi.
      </p>

      <!-- Highlight cards -->
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 mt-1">
        {[
          {
            icon: "💻",
            title: "Pengembangan Web",
            desc: "Aplikasi fullstack dengan React, Go (Fiber/Gin), dan PostgreSQL, di-deploy ke AWS EC2 memakai Docker.",
            color: "bg-cyan-50 text-cyan-700",
          },
          {
            icon: "📊",
            title: "Data Science",
            desc: "Analisis data dan model machine learning dasar (Random Forest, Logistic Regression) dengan Python, Pandas, dan Streamlit.",
            color: "bg-amber-50 text-amber-700",
          },
          {
            icon: "🔐",
            title: "DevOps & Keamanan",
            desc: "Pipeline CI/CD di GitHub Actions dengan security scanning dasar (GitLeaks, Trivy, OWASP ZAP) — masih terus belajar.",
            color: "bg-violet-50 text-violet-700",
          },
        ].map(h => (
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-white rounded-2xl p-4 border border-slate-100 shadow-sm text-left hover:translate-x-1.5 transition-transform">
            <span class={`flex-shrink-0 p-2 rounded-xl text-lg ${h.color}`}>{h.icon}</span>
            <div>
              <p class="font-semibold text-slate-800 text-sm">{h.title}</p>
              <p class="text-slate-500 text-xs mt-0.5">{h.desc}</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
